/E (Public transportation is an essential part of daily life for students, commuters, tourists, and office workers. However, transportation information in Malaysia is often distributed across multiple platforms, making it difficult for users to search for stations, compare transport options, and plan their journeys efficiently. Smart Transit MY is developed to provide a centralized platform that integrates Malaysian Government Open Data, enabling users to easily access transportation information and make informed travel decisions.)
